  "text": "### Critical Bugs Fixed\n\n1. **500 Error on Video Uploads**\n   - Location: `src/index.mjs:565`\n   - Issue: `new BunnyUploadHandler()` missing `env` parameter\n   - Fix: `new BunnyUploadHandler(env)`\n   - Triggered when: Videos routed to BunnyStream (BUNNY_UPLOAD_DEST=bunny)\n\n2. **Missing Signature Verification**\n   - Location: `src/index.mjs:748-760` (verifyBlossomAuth)\n   - Issue: Accepted ANY kind 24242 event without validating signatures\n   - Fix: Implemented full NIP-01 verification with @noble/curves\n   - Added: `verifyNostrSignature()` function using Schnorr/BIP-340\n\n3. **POST Method Not Supported**\n   - Location: `src/index.mjs:195` and line 65 (CORS)\n   - Issue: Server only accepted PUT, client was sending POST\n   - Fix: Accept both PUT and POST per Postel's Law\n\n### Architecture Notes\n\n**BunnyUploadHandler Pattern:**\n- Constructor requires `env` to create BunnyStreamClient\n- Stores `env` as instance variable in `this.env`\n- Uses `_getClient()` lazy initialization pattern\n- Methods also receive `env` as parameter (redundant but kept for compatibility)\n\n**Upload Flow for Videos:**\n1. `handleUploadBlob()` calls `selectUploadStrategy()`\n2. Strategy checks `BUNNY_UPLOAD_DEST` env var\n3. If \"bunny\", creates BunnyUploadHandler and initiates upload\n4. BunnyUploadHandler creates BunnyStreamClient with credentials\n5. Returns video ID and GUID for metadata storage\n\n**Environment Variables:**\n- `DEV_AUTH_MODE`: \"false\" in production, \"true\" for dev (secure by default)\n- `BUNNY_STREAM_ENABLED`: \"true\" to enable BunnyStream integration\n- `BUNNY_UPLOAD_DEST`: \"bunny\", \"r2\", or \"dual\" (routing strategy)\n- `BUNNY_STREAM_ACCESS_KEY`: Secret for BunnyStream API\n- `BUNNY_STREAM_LIBRARY_ID`: Library ID for video uploads\n\n### Testing Gotchas\n\n1. **DEV_AUTH_MODE in tests** - Mock env has `DEV_AUTH_MODE: 'true'`\n2. **Signature verification skipped in dev** - Need real signatures for production testing\n3. **BunnyUploadHandler needs env** - Don't forget constructor parameter\n4. **CORS test needs POST** - Updated to include POST in allowed methods\n\n### Deployment Notes\n\n- Only two environments now: dev (local) and production\n- Removed staging environment (was unused)\n- Production URL: https://blossom.divine.video\n- Deploy with: `npm run deploy` (deploys to production)\n\n### Security Model\n\n**Production (DEV_AUTH_MODE=false):**\n- Full Schnorr signature verification\n- Event ID validation\n- SHA-256 hash verification for uploads\n- Reject all invalid signatures\n\n**Development (DEV_AUTH_MODE=true):**\n- Can use simple `Authorization: Nostr pubkey=<hex>` format\n- Skips signature verification (for testing only)\n- Still validates event structure\n\n### Documentation Created\n\n- `CHANGELOG.md` - Version history\n- `BLOSSOM_CLIENT_SPEC.md` - Complete API spec for Flutter dev\n- `SECURITY_FIX_SUMMARY.md` - Security audit documentation\n- Updated `README.md` - Removed staging, added security section",
  "sections": [
    "Project Notes",
    "Blossom SDK Worker - Production Issues Fixed (2025-10-28)"
  ],
